Package: svoya-jackson
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12)
Recommends: libsecret-tools, git
Description: Jackson, the SOS assistant
 Jackson routes requests to local or cloud models, runs tools and agents in
 sandboxes, asks before anything risky with an exact preview, keeps a
 tamper-evident log and undoes its own actions through snapshots.
 .
 This package ships the "jackson" command (short: "j") and the
 jacksond.service user unit. Nothing starts by itself: the SOS session
 starts Jackson only when AI features are enabled.
